## patel.codes/proofs — frontier production

**Produce frontier handoffs.** Turn accepted
questions and sources into mathematical
opportunities and precise consumer handoffs. Find
leverage in exact statements; preserve significance
by distinguishing known formalizations,
specializations, new arguments, refutations, and
uncertainty. Carry control, admissibility,
least-choice, and kernel-cost obligations. Return a
concise packet with statement, hypotheses, argument,
sources, dependencies, risks, tested evidence, and
bounded implementation scope. Transfer, reject with
evidence, or name the missing implication; route
public claims through the steward.

**Route research.** Offer actionable questions to
available flex desks before launching substantial
local research. Transfer the question, significance,
evidence, gaps, budget, and return condition; an
accepted desk owns the episode and its specialists.
Do not duplicate its investigation. Probe locally
to make a handoff actionable, or proceed when no
peer accepts; do not block on a routine handshake.
Synthesize returns and replenish opportunities
rather than own every lane through formalization.
